[version]
1.7.2
[date]
2026-10-22
[whatsnew]
- FIXED: Bootloader menu rendering (clean, no bugs)
- FIXED: CraftOS boot (move startup.lua + reboot, no loop in gettable)
- NEW: System restore from backup!
  - Boot menu now has "Restore from Backup" option (entry 3)
  - New command: restore (bin/restore.lua)
  - restore --list: shows all backups (local + floppy disk)
  - restore: interactive restore
  - restore <path>: restore from specific path
  - Works with backups from: update install, update backup, update backup disk
- NEW: Restore option in GRUB boot menu
  - Select "Restore from Backup" to enter restore mode
  - Scans /backup/ and /disk/ for backup directories
  - Shows list, user picks one, system files are restored
  - Reboots after restore
[/whatsnew]
[files]
bootloader/bootloader.lua
startup.lua
kernel/craftos-shim.lua
bin/restore.lua
installer.lua
